FFmpegGUI OS modern3 GPL AIO release validation
Date: 2026-08-12 JST

Release scope
-------------
The standard arm64 Release now contains the reproducible GPL AIO FFmpeg
runtime. It adds mpdecimate, drawtext, ass/subtitles, libaribcaption with its
renderer, libx264, libx265, libvpx-vp9, and libaom-av1. FDK AAC stays outside
the standard build and is available only through the isolated local
nonredistributable recipe.

AI-generated commands use the versioned FFMPEGGUI_COMMAND_V1 envelope, default
to one global -y, and validate filter names against the intersection of the
active FFmpeg inventory and a conservative in-memory-only policy. mpdecimate
is allowed; invented names and file/model/socket filters fail closed. BYOK,
manual paste, and direct clipboard reading share the same validation path.

